html","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":379,"end":404,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-e0f7b97e0f4b4257d2b7","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"夫人乃还缞绖，奉览、员首，以祭翊墓。举军震骇，以为神异","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":550,"end":577,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-f322729b1771bdb3ae8a","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"时月垂竟，览听须祭毕。徐潜使所亲信，语翊亲近旧将孙高、傅婴等，说：‘览已虏略婢妾，今又欲见逼；所以外许之者，欲安其意以免祸耳。欲立微计，愿二君哀救！’高、婴涕泣答言：‘受府君恩遇，所以不即死难者，以死无益，欲思惟事计；事计未立，未敢启夫人耳。今日之事，实夙夜所怀也","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":245,"end":377,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-feb340e6a390f4c8beb6","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-c5f54d00c6afc536d9f8","layer":"pei","quote":"翊出入常持刀，尔时有酒色，空手送客；鸿从后斫翊，郡中扰乱，无救翊者：遂为鸿所杀，迸走入山","attribution":"裴注·吴历","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":192,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-35b20a58e0364598ee58","start":118,"end":162,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
